 ### 8. Deliver
 
+Bring the finished mp4 to reel loudness, -10 LUFS, after `verify-audio.py`
+passes (that check needs the mix untouched). Image is copied, not re-encoded:
+
+```bash
+python scripts/loudness.py out/name.mp4
+```
+
+It writes `out/name-loud.mp4` and prints the integrated loudness and true peak.
+Plain `loudnorm` stalls near -15 LUFS on speech (its peak ceiling caps the
+gain), so the script compresses, adds gain into a limiter and re-measures.
+Accept -10 to -12 LUFS with true peak at or under -1 dBFS, then
+`mv out/name-loud.mp4 out/name.mp4`. Lower than -12 or a peak warning: listen
+for pumping and check the mix before delivering.
+
 Send the finished mp4. When a note touches only one beat, also send that segment
